sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operator
    participant P as Microlith Process
    participant L as HandlerLoader
    participant R as Router
    Op ->> P: start
    Note over P,L: Bootstrap Microlith
    P ->> L: load handler sources (inline, JAR, remote)
    alt all sources initialize without conflict
        L ->> R: register capabilities
        R -->> P: ready, accepting requests
    else lifecycle holder fails to initialize
        L -->> P: initialization error
        P -->> Op: startup aborted, process exits
    else duplicate capability name across sources
        L -->> P: IllegalStateException (duplicate capability)
        P -->> Op: startup aborted before router built
    end
    Op ->> P: stop
    Note over P,R: Shut Down Microlith
    P ->> R: close()
    alt clean shutdown
        R -->> P: in-flight handlers complete, resources released
    else one lifecycle holder's shutdown fails
        R -->> P: error logged, remaining holders still shut down
    end
    Note over L,R: Code: io.eventbob.core.EventBob, HandlerLoader, EventBobBundle / EventBobConfig
    Note over L,R: Tests: EventBobTest, JarHandlerLoaderTest, LifecycleHandlerLoaderTest, EventBobBundleTest, EventBobConfigTest
